---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Move to UK from Africa – Free Tools & Guides | AfriMigrate"
  description="Everything you need to move to the UK from Africa: Skilled Worker visa eligibility checker, visa cost calculator, and the roadmap from visa to ILR — all free."
>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / UK</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">United Kingdom</div>
  <h1>Move to the UK, step by step</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
    The UK's Skilled Worker route is the main door for African professionals with a job offer from a licensed sponsor. Free tools to check your eligibility, budget for the real cost, and plan your route from visa to settlement (Indefinite Leave to Remain).
  </p>

  <div class="tools-grid">
    <div class="tool-card">
      <div class="hot">Most used</div>
      <div class="tool-icon">✅</div>
      <h3>Skilled Worker Visa Checker</h3>
      <p>Check whether you meet the core requirements for a UK Skilled Worker visa in under 2 minutes.</p>
      <a href="/uk/skilled-worker-visa-checker" class="tool-link">Check my eligibility →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-card">
      <div class="tool-icon">💷</div>
      <h3>Visa Cost Calculator</h3>
      <p>Calculate the real cost of a UK visa — application fee, Immigration Health Surcharge, and dependents.</p>
      <a href="/uk/visa-cost-calculator" class="tool-link">Calculate the cost →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-card">
      <div class="tool-icon">🗺️</div>
      <h3>Visa to ILR Roadmap</h3>
      <p>The full path from your first Skilled Worker visa to Indefinite Leave to Remain and British citizenship.</p>
      <a href="/uk/ilr-roadmap" class="tool-link">See the roadmap →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Why the UK</div>
    <h2>A well-trodden path for African professionals</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Healthcare, IT, engineering and education roles are consistently in demand on the UK's Immigration Salary List, and Skilled Worker visa holders can bring a spouse and children from day one. After five years of continuous residence, most visa holders become eligible to settle permanently.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
